--- each_codepoint {|codepoint| block } -> self
--- each_codepoint -> Enumerator

文字列の各コードポイントに対して繰り返します。

   #coding:UTF-8
   "hello わーるど".each_codepoint.to_a
   # => [104, 101, 108, 108, 111, 32, 12431, 12540, 12427, 12393]

@see [[m:String#codepoints]]

